      "body": "## Motivation\n\nFixes #42068. A failed `/hicache/storage-backend/clear` request returns HTTP 400 but currently says the storage backend was cleared.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Return a failure message when `ret.success` is false; preserve the successful response and status codes.\n- Add a regression to the existing endpoint suite, whose server has hierarchical cache disabled.\n\n`ClearHiCacheReqOutput` only exposes `success`, so this does not assume a `message` field or change the response format.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Native FastAPI/Starlette TestClient dispatch of the exact handler, with a success-only manager stub: baseline reproduces the misleading failure body; candidate success/failure controls pass. This is an isolated handler test, not a full SGLang import or model-server test.\n- Ruff 0.15.1 checks/format and `git diff --check` pass.\n- The added registered server regression has **not** been run locally; my available environment lacks the matching SGLang kernel/FlashInfer stack. Maintainer CI is needed for that test.\n\nNo inference or performance changes. AI assistance was used for source review, implementation and the isolated reproduction.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Ruff checks and formatting for changed files.\n- [x] Add focused regression coverage.\n- [ ] Run the registered server regression in CI.\n\n@slin1237 could you review this API fix and help trigger the endpoint CI?\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #36886223247](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36886223247)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #36886222842](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36886222842)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #36886223027](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36886223027)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-s